{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"iddi-and-the-sugar-bugs","version":1,"title":"Iddi and the Sugar Bugs","ageTiers":["5-6","7-8"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Iddi loved sweets. He ate sweets in the morning. He ate sweets after lunch. He ate sweets at night. Yum, yum, yum!","sentences":["Iddi loved sweets.","He ate sweets in the morning.","He ate sweets after lunch.","He ate sweets at night.","Yum, yum, yum!"],"alt":"A boy happily eats a pile of sweets.","image":{"hash":"sha256:dd8e4d858607c12dd220ea2093af48774cb87f046fb17bf192ed5d599b3a617e","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:8beb14047b3b2b1b52c7da6682a199dd4a08fbf161235f3762403ee237c9cc68","durationMs":13040,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2256],[2256,5504],[5504,8503],[8503,11131],[11131,13040]],"words":[[0,496],[496,1116],[1116,2256],[2256,2504],[2504,2876],[2876,3619],[3619,3867],[3867,4239],[4239,5504],[5504,5751],[5751,6123],[6123,6867],[6867,7487],[7487,8503],[8503,8751],[8751,9123],[9123,9867],[9867,10115],[10115,11131],[11131,11701],[11701,12271],[12271,13040]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"But Iddi did not like brushing his teeth. ‘Too boring!’ he said. He ran away from his toothbrush every morning.","sentences":["But Iddi did not like brushing his teeth.","‘Too boring!’ he said.","He ran away from his toothbrush every morning."],"alt":"A boy runs away from a toothbrush held by his mother.","image":{"hash":"sha256:8cf969bae57bd1f38c38f021214b763be3c83cfba664a0a7e0361e4703ad74ac","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:dd3be50660f9b15e938a83038a33c06f502f524248b4f7a90bd2d2e5258d2332","durationMs":11360,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4162],[4162,6623],[6623,11360]],"words":[[0,345],[345,805],[805,1150],[1150,1495],[1495,1955],[1955,2874],[2874,3219],[3219,4162],[4162,4507],[4507,5565],[5565,5795],[5795,6623],[6623,6853],[6853,7198],[7198,7658],[7658,8118],[8118,8463],[8463,9612],[9612,10187],[10187,11360]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"One day, Iddi got a toothache. Ouch! It hurt a lot. ‘Ow, ow, ow!’ he cried. His mother took him to see the nurse at school.","sentences":["One day, Iddi got a toothache.","Ouch!","It hurt a lot.","‘Ow, ow, ow!’ he cried.","His mother took him to see the nurse at school."],"alt":"A boy holds his cheek and winces in pain.","image":{"hash":"sha256:8477aa61635e13da4ac3ed61cec706a6d13b6a16031ef7408f1f7a6d6934e88f","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:a10c9a526a5fa3d1b01a7110c9c3940bc8e99a9619796d82daccd7c7fde8e73a","durationMs":17080,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4278],[4278,5386],[5386,7417],[7417,10894],[10894,17080]],"words":[[0,462],[462,1169],[1169,1785],[1785,2247],[2247,2400],[2400,4278],[4278,5386],[5386,5693],[5693,6309],[6309,6463],[6463,7417],[7417,7971],[7971,8525],[8525,9325],[9325,9633],[9633,10894],[10894,11356],[11356,12279],[12279,12895],[12895,13356],[13356,13664],[13664,14126],[14126,14587],[14587,15357],[15357,15664],[15664,17080]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"Nurse Manu looked in Iddi’s mouth. ‘You have a hole in your tooth,’ she said. ‘Tiny germs in your mouth love sugar. They make holes in teeth. Let me show you.’","sentences":["Nurse Manu looked in Iddi’s mouth.","‘You have a hole in your tooth,’ she said.","‘Tiny germs in your mouth love sugar.","They make holes in teeth.","Let me show you.’"],"alt":"A school nurse points at a model of a mouth with cartoon germs.","image":{"hash":"sha256:2a97854546e0783f9df01b4903ea87b40e00c3cf986d6e7ad8226a27278dff85","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:6a51aee5937a35e87e393af7ef607e41168fc288be162e3719568856481f1497","durationMs":17560,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3911],[3911,8417],[8417,12587],[12587,15592],[15592,17560]],"words":[[0,647],[647,1165],[1165,1942],[1942,2201],[2201,2849],[2849,3911],[3911,4299],[4299,4817],[4817,4947],[4947,5465],[5465,5724],[5724,6242],[6242,7097],[7097,7485],[7485,8417],[8417,8935],[8935,9583],[9583,9842],[9842,10360],[10360,11007],[11007,11525],[11525,12587],[12587,13105],[13105,13623],[13623,14271],[14271,14530],[14530,15592],[15592,15980],[15980,16239],[16239,16757],[16757,17560]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"She drew little sugar bugs with party hats on the board. ‘They have a party every time you eat sweets,’ she said. ‘And they leave holes in your teeth!’ Iddi’s eyes went wide.","sentences":["She drew little sugar bugs with party hats on the board.","‘They have a party every time you eat sweets,’ she said.","‘And they leave holes in your teeth!’ Iddi’s eyes went wide."],"alt":"Cartoon sugar bugs with party hats dance on a board.","image":{"hash":"sha256:5ac47c6550e4ae15e2af9d3dda7f51c00c9b6e9435b79231e48bf63555704da4","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:e912caebf46a60662ee0a64b5c658d8b504a0ffd57667d34e23b8ea08116a8f3","durationMs":17640,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5808],[5808,11447],[11447,17640]],"words":[[0,361],[361,843],[843,1566],[1566,2169],[2169,2651],[2651,3133],[3133,3735],[3735,4217],[4217,4458],[4458,4820],[4820,5808],[5808,6290],[6290,6772],[6772,6892],[6892,7495],[7495,8097],[8097,8579],[8579,8940],[8940,9302],[9302,10218],[10218,10579],[10579,11447],[11447,11808],[11808,12290],[12290,12893],[12893,13495],[13495,13736],[13736,14218],[14218,15206],[15206,15809],[15809,16290],[16290,16772],[16772,17640]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"‘So what must I do?’ asked Iddi. ‘Brush your teeth in the morning and at night,’ said Nurse Manu. ‘Use a little toothpaste. Brush for about two minutes.’","sentences":["‘So what must I do?’ asked Iddi.","‘Brush your teeth in the morning and at night,’ said Nurse Manu.","‘Use a little toothpaste.","Brush for about two minutes.’"],"alt":"A nurse shows a boy how to brush with a toothbrush.","image":{"hash":"sha256:47a53488e4354e99710a3bc22505d67ec36be617e56e3b452f6e4581b8febb18","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:fcfdbc227e8e1675f9abd74dfd829298c9dcfbe04376da333e78c0e40548d003","durationMs":17920,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3867],[3867,11193],[11193,14352],[14352,17920]],"words":[[0,272],[272,817],[817,1362],[1362,1498],[1498,2206],[2206,2887],[2887,3867],[3867,4548],[4548,5093],[5093,5774],[5774,6046],[6046,6454],[6454,7408],[7408,7816],[7816,8089],[8089,8987],[8987,9532],[9532,10213],[10213,11193],[11193,11602],[11602,11738],[11738,12555],[12555,14352],[14352,15033],[15033,15442],[15442,16123],[16123,16531],[16531,17920]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"‘And eat fewer sweets,’ she added. ‘Have fruit instead. And see a dentist to check your teeth.’ Iddi nodded. ‘No more party for the sugar bugs!’ he said.","sentences":["‘And eat fewer sweets,’ she added.","‘Have fruit instead.","And see a dentist to check your teeth.’ Iddi nodded.","‘No more party for the sugar bugs!’ he said."],"alt":"A boy holds an apple and waves goodbye to the sugar bugs.","image":{"hash":"sha256:7356b35d72796b1801a83cf69e470c594ad4546895fca58b17eba4f9c36e49b3","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:22f8b1113b8fb1eec13161c90985086fe18e760488fbd4308c67480231ad10d6","durationMs":16600,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3697],[3697,6079],[6079,11836],[11836,16600]],"words":[[0,372],[372,744],[744,1365],[1365,2308],[2308,2680],[2680,3697],[3697,4193],[4193,4814],[4814,6079],[6079,6451],[6451,6824],[6824,6948],[6948,7816],[7816,8064],[8064,8685],[8685,9181],[9181,10198],[10198,10694],[10694,11836],[11836,12084],[12084,12580],[12580,13201],[13201,13573],[13573,13945],[13945,14565],[14565,15459],[15459,15707],[15707,16600]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"Now Iddi brushes every morning and every night. His teeth are clean and shiny. He still likes sweets, but only a few. The end.","sentences":["Now Iddi brushes every morning and every night.","His teeth are clean and shiny.","He still likes sweets, but only a few.","The end."],"alt":"A boy grins with clean teeth in front of a mirror.","image":{"hash":"sha256:4ab3b980d50f7ac26dbffd1d4b2621f0e7ab7ed7ac1107dc611192c2e8e666f8","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:4cc933f397e56fb5ce3ed349f7e4710b44ece810676bac4b35bdac4c0fff17be","durationMs":15120,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5677],[5677,9336],[9336,13882],[13882,15120]],"words":[[0,404],[404,942],[942,1883],[1883,2556],[2556,3498],[3498,3901],[3901,4574],[4574,5677],[5677,6080],[6080,6753],[6753,7156],[7156,7829],[7829,8233],[8233,9336],[9336,9605],[9605,10277],[10277,10950],[10950,11972],[11972,12376],[12376,12914],[12914,13048],[13048,13882],[13882,14286],[14286,15120]]}}}],"activities":[{"id":"iddi-c1","type":"comprehension","afterPage":3,"question":"What happened to Iddi’s tooth?","options":["It hurt","It fell off","It turned blue"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"iddi-c2","type":"comprehension","afterPage":6,"question":"When should Iddi brush his teeth?","options":["Morning and night","Only on Sundays","Never"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"iddi-ph","type":"phonics","afterPage":6,"targetSound":"br","prompt":"Which words start with the br sound, like brush?","options":["brush","bug","bread","bright"],"correctIndexes":[0,2,3]},{"id":"iddi-s1","type":"sequencing","prompt":"Put the story in order.","items":["Iddi ate lots of sweets.","Iddi got a toothache.","The nurse explained about sugar bugs.","Iddi began to brush every day."]},{"id":"iddi-sel","type":"sel","afterPage":8,"prompt":"Iddi changed his habits to look after his teeth. How do you feel about looking after yourself?","feelingOptions":["Proud","Healthy","Determined","Happy"]}],"glossary":[{"word":"toothache","definition":"A pain in a tooth.","pages":[3]},{"word":"germs","definition":"Tiny living things too small to see.","pages":[4]},{"word":"dentist","definition":"A person who looks after teeth.","pages":[7]}],"assets":{"sha256:dd8e4d858607c12dd220ea2093af48774cb87f046fb17bf192ed5d599b3a617e":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/iddi-and-the-sugar-bugs/page1-1.webp","bytes":72414,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:8beb14047b3b2b1b52c7da6682a199dd4a08fbf161235f3762403ee237c9cc68":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/8beb14047b3b.mp3","bytes":105068,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:8cf969bae57bd1f38c38f021214b763be3c83cfba664a0a7e0361e4703ad74ac":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/iddi-and-the-sugar-bugs/page2-1.webp","bytes":85720,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:dd3be50660f9b15e938a83038a33c06f502f524248b4f7a90bd2d2e5258d2332":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/dd3be50660f9.mp3","bytes":91628,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:8477aa61635e13da4ac3ed61cec706a6d13b6a16031ef7408f1f7a6d6934e88f":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/iddi-and-the-sugar-bugs/page3-1.webp","bytes":82786,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:a10c9a526a5fa3d1b01a7110c9c3940bc8e99a9619796d82daccd7c7fde8e73a":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/a10c9a526a5f.mp3","bytes":137324,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:2a97854546e0783f9df01b4903ea87b40e00c3cf986d6e7ad8226a27278dff85":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/iddi-and-the-sugar-bugs/page4-1.webp","bytes":81048,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:6a51aee5937a35e87e393af7ef607e41168fc288be162e3719568856481f1497":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/6a51aee5937a.mp3","bytes":141164,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:5ac47c6550e4ae15e2af9d3dda7f51c00c9b6e9435b79231e48bf63555704da4":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/iddi-and-the-sugar-bugs/page5-1.webp","bytes":83722,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:e912caebf46a60662ee0a64b5c658d8b504a0ffd57667d34e23b8ea08116a8f3":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/e912caebf46a.mp3","bytes":141740,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:47a53488e4354e99710a3bc22505d67ec36be617e56e3b452f6e4581b8febb18":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/iddi-and-the-sugar-bugs/page6-1.webp","bytes":70590,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:fcfdbc227e8e1675f9abd74dfd82